  PlaceName: Billy Biggs Blacksmith Shop
  Icon: {fileID: 5313899257800184255, guid: 57ae5ca6bf3c7d1409c564a5e42fb4d9, type: 3}
  Color: {r: 0.9215687, g: 0.9215687, b: 0.94117653, a: 1}
  Content: "\"Patient 0: Sinthia\"\nmo knight\nA haunting blend of performance and
    handmade dolls introduces Sinthia\u2014an enigmatic figure promising escape from
    loneliness and despair. Surrender to her presence and transcend the limits of
    earthly suffering.\n\n\"Dealer\u2019s Choice (Doll Distribution)\"\nGabe McLellan\nThis
    mixed media installation uses dolls as unsettling symbols of control and identity,
    spread across collage, video, print, and book. Viewers are challenged to confront
    the eerie power dynamics at play in these surrogate figures.\"\n"
  RavenSucessScript: "\u201CDolls whisper here\u2014of pain, power, and strange salvation.
    You\u2019ve entered a forge of identity where the uncanny rules the room.\u201D"
  RavenHintScript: "\u201CRemember: the art\u2019s outside the game too\u2014look
    up, look around, soak it in!\u201D"
  Url: https://www.google.ca/maps/place/Billy+Bigg's+Blacksmith+Shop/@64.0604097,-139.4367591,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x5148e35d00efccb3:0x5cb675df15e5f1a0!8m2!3d64.0604074!4d-139.4341842!16s%2Fg%2F11t9cy672p?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDUwNi4wIKXMDSoJLDEwMjExNDU1SAFQAw%3D%3D
  Position: {x: 0, y: 0}
  VoteTitles:
